1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,370
Picture your boss

2
00:00:01,410 --> 00:00:02,820
walking you past your desk

3
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:04,360
to a tiny room.

4
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,390
No computer.

5
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:06,370
No work.

6
00:00:06,410 --> 00:00:07,720
Just a ticking clock,

7
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,690
and a man in the corner

8
00:00:08,730 --> 00:00:10,080
with his feet up.

9
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:10,900
Your new job,

10
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:11,960
your boss says,

11
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:12,990
is nothing.

12
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:14,790
Sit here until six.

13
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:15,460
At first

14
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,110
it feels like a holiday.

15
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:18,230
Then co-workers

16
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:19,500
start staring.

17
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,860
The emails stop.

18
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:21,540
Your old desk

19
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:23,640
has someone else's photos on it.

20
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:24,430
Every Friday

21
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:26,610
your boss leans in, smiling,

22
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:27,680
to ask how you're enjoying

23
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,010
your new role.

24
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:29,860
The man in the corner

25
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:31,300
has been here for years,

26
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:33,460
so you put your feet up too.

27
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,920
Then one Monday,

28
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,200
his chair is empty

29
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:38,090
and his desk is cleared.

30
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:38,850
In Japan,

31
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:39,690
firing someone

32
00:00:39,730 --> 00:00:40,850
without a strong reason

33
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:42,210
is very hard.

34
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:43,270
So some companies

35
00:00:43,310 --> 00:00:44,440
take away the work,

36
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,120
and wait for you to leave.

37
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:47,160
Japan calls them

38
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:48,690
chase-out rooms.

39
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:49,600
Subscribe for more

40
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:51,650
strange facts like this.
